Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.

